  "scope": "Pure v3 manifest only. No runtime, SQL, claim, dispatch, application, provider, HTTP or Archive activation.",
  "implementation": [
    "New immutable BasisV3 requires source v2 and annual v2; separate public build/assert/serialize APIs return the existing immutable manifest result.",
    "production-source-approval-v3 records source.codec rf1086-year-source-v2 independently of the correction ordinal and separately binds original enumeration, chain enumeration andcombined Governance projection hashes.",
    "Required annual-readiness-binding-v2 retains exact proof text and hashes. Required versus accepted warnings, actor/entitlement/review and exact submission-predecessor reason remain explicit.",
    "Share canonical bytes, UTF8 shareholder operation-key/order projection and predecessor formatting in one private helper. Existing v1/v2 buildervalidationorder and source_production._canonical import compatibility remain.",
    "New basis/preview/actor/predecessor and manifest types are checked; owner source integrity preserves its valid historical economic numeric representations. Source-aware assert rebuilds every field and XML byte.",
    "Serializer checks v3 markers, source codec, annual binding envelope and byte hash only. It can encode a self-consistent incomplete manifest; source-aware assert rejects it. No caller may treat serialization as approval or authorization."
  ],
